{"synopsis":"Dari studio yang merilis TalentSwallowing Magician and DragonDevouring Mage\nRaja iblis Zeke Mohr jadilah seseorang yang berbuat baik di kehidupanmu selanjutnya\nPahlawan itu berteriak kepada sang Demon King of Power Zeke yang menemui ajalnya\nKetika dia membuka matanya dia pun tersadar bahwa dirinya telah kembali menjadi Zeke Steelwill sebelum menjadi raja iblis\nDi kehidupan kali ini dia tidak punya keinginan untuk menjadi penerus ataupun Raja Iblis\nLalu apa Itu benar Mungkin aku akan melakukan kebaikan seperti yang dikatakan pahlawan itu\nTapi bagaimana cara dia melakukannya Si Mantan Raja Iblis ini tidak terbiasa dengan konsep kebaikan","alternative_title":"회귀한 마왕은 착하게 산다","author":"Hungry Panda","artist":"Studio Inus","chapters":[{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"186a75b9-dbfc-4d57-91ff-580363b37594","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"a60036f4-35e3-4a00-b06e-dbee2fbfbe03","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"c5ea972b-649b-4950-9f57-fda72e894b9b","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"9afeba21-021b-4dd0-a473-6aa36f0e73a3","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"4e7e57ed-ef94-46de-a52d-69a46eb30ead","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"5207038c-6ef9-4d63-8dd7-32820ed9cda8","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"fc9dfbba-ec25-4150-b0e6-efb52fc8b7df","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"e298838d-3f1c-4513-a7cd-051ca8c0170f","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"3d8ecd75-50ef-44d3-9db4-e42f6290218e","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"ac53d570-e262-4725-8a50-dd490a14f964","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2024-12-01"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"117c5b65-a5d1-4510-89b1